rd lock<\\/li>\\n            <\\/ul>\"},{\"id\":\"hello-biz-1.0.6\",\"title\":\"1.0.6 - 2025-03-30\",\"description\":\"\\n            <ul>\\n                <li>Tweak: Update the theme description<\\/li>\\n            <\\/ul>\"},{\"id\":\"hello-biz-1.0.5\",\"title\":\"1.0.5 - 2025-03-16\",\"description\":\"\\n            <ul>\\n                <li>Tweak: Update the theme readme file<\\/li>\\n            <\\/ul>\"},{\"id\":\"hello-biz-1.0.4\",\"title\":\"1.0.4 - 2025-03-02\",\"description\":\"\\n            <ul>\\n                <li>Tweak: Add \\\"changelog\\\" modal to theme settings page<\\/li>\\n                <li>Tweak: Add FAQ section to theme info<\\/li>\\n                <li>Fix: Prevent duplicated Header\\/Footer view in Editor<\\/li>\\n            <\\/ul>\"},{\"id\":\"hello-biz-1.0.3\",\"title\":\"1.0.3 - 2025-02-11\",\"description\":\"\\n            <ul>\\n                <li>Tweak: Allow Skipping the default Header\\/Footer templates<\\/li>\\n            <\\/ul>\"},{\"id\":\"hello-biz-1.0.2\",\"title\":\"1.0.2 - 2025-01-22\",\"description\":\"\\n            <ul>\\n                <li>Tweak: Theme URI<\\/li>\\n                <li>Fix: Add missing translation strings<\\/li>\\n            <\\/ul>\"},{\"id\":\"hello-biz-1.0.1\",\"title\":\"1.0.1 - 2024-12-24\",\"description\":\"\\n            <ul>\\n                <li>Tweak: Improved Gutenberg support<\\/li>\\n                <li>Tweak: Use CSS Logical properties<\\/li>\\n            <\\/ul>\"},{\"id\":\"hello-biz-1.0.0\",\"title\":\"1.0.0 - 2024-12-11\",\"description\":\"\\n            <ul>\\n                <li>Tweak: Minify starter-content images<\\/li>\\n                <li>Fix: Settings page styling<\\/li>\\n            <\\/ul>\"},{\"id\":\"hello-biz-0.0.6\",\"title\":\"0.0.6 - 2024-12-04\",\"description\":\"\\n            <ul>\\n                <li>New: Add starter content<\\/li>\\n           <\\/ul>\"},{\"id\":\"hello-biz-0.0.5\",\"title\":\"0.0.5 - 2024-11-25\",\"description\":\"\\n            <ul>\