(401,	'This site uses SureCookie to ask visitors for their cookie choice and to record it.',	'surecookie',	'trp_context',	'',	'458f5c49b64162b676c6d9135fb43b2a'),
(402,	'When a visitor answers the cookie banner, their choice is stored in their browser and, unless consent logging is switched off, a record is also kept on this site. That record holds the date and time, which cookie categories were allowed or refused, a randomly generated identifier from a cookie in the visitor\'s browser, a shortened form of their IP address, the country the visit resolved to, and their user ID if they were signed in.',	'surecookie',	'trp_context',	'',	'2b97475aacfeb5db3ea7abfc7d92ab00'),
(403,	'To resolve that country, the visitor\'s full IP address is sent to a geolocation service operated by Brainstorm Force at %1$s. Only the country is returned, and only the shortened address is stored on this site. That service is hosted in %2$s. Requests reach it through a content delivery network operated by a company based in the %3$s, so that provider belongs on your sub-processor list with its own transfer mechanism.',	'surecookie',	'trp_context',	'',	'91f4ddd7673d7d0418606cdba76252f3'),
(404,	'How long consent records are kept is a setting on this site. Consent records are deliberately excluded from the personal data eraser, because they are the evidence that consent was given.',	'surecookie',	'trp_context',	'',	'9f2f696d05907843beb5c5f2e6d64805'),
(405,	'SureCookie can also generate a privacy policy draft for this site, under Compliance in the SureCookie menu.',	'surecookie',	'trp_context',	'',	'4dcaa2013c3703adb3818d2bfc1d7b53'),
